{"id":"c1cc99c8ec1e8071","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-system-f-church-numerals.md","title":"System F的Church数码","display":"df-system-f-church-numerals — System F的Church数码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-system-f-church-numerals","aliases":["72-df-system-f-church-numerals"],"display":"df-system-f-church-numerals — System F的Church数码","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-f]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §10 polymorphic functionals (context); supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.5.1 print88/PDF96, https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf; local explicit Church encoding","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-system-f-church-numerals"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-system-f-church-numerals</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-system-f-church-numerals — System F的Church数码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §10 polymorphic functionals (context); supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.5.1 print88/PDF96, <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>; local explicit Church encoding"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>类型与项取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V_T\">\\(U\\in V_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,x\\in V_t\">\\(f,x\\in V_t\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,X\\in\\Lambda_F\">\\(F,X\\in\\Lambda_F\\)</span> 是迭代输入项；所有绑定项按既定 α 类读取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_0(F,X):=X,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_{n+1}(F,X):=F\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{It}_0(F,X):=X,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_{n+1}(F,X):=F\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Nat}_F:=\\forall U.((U\\to U)\\to(U\\to U)),\\qquad\n\\mathsf c_n:=\\Lambda U.\\lambda f:U\\to U.\\lambda x:U.\\operatorname{It}_n(f,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Nat}_F:=\\forall U.((U\\to U)\\to(U\\to U)),\\qquad\n\\mathsf c_n:=\\Lambda U.\\lambda f:U\\to U.\\lambda x:U.\\operatorname{It}_n(f,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是多态函数编码；数码不是本册 PER 自然数关系的闭项构造，也不是额外加入 System F 的原始自然数类型。有限项递归唯一生成每个数码，n=0保留返回初始参数的分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类型与项取 [[72-df-system-f]]；$U\\in V_T$，$f,x\\in V_t$ 互异，$n\\in\\omega$。$F,X\\in\\Lambda_F$ 是迭代输入项；所有绑定项按既定 α 类读取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"f,x\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"F,X\\in\\Lambda_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_0(F,X):=X,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_{n+1}(F,X):=F\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Nat}_F:=\\forall U.((U\\to U)\\to(U\\to U)),\\qquad\n\\mathsf c_n:=\\Lambda U.\\lambda f:U\\to U.\\lambda x:U.\\operatorname{It}_n(f,x).","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4e6344487b1da6c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$；$A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F$，$\\Gamma\\vdash_F F:A\\to A$，$\\Gamma\\vdash_F X:A$。$\\operatorname{It}_n,\\mathsf c_n,\\mathsf{Nat}_F$ 取 [[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]]，项、类型及归约取其System F接口；两种代入使用 [[72-lem-system-f-substitution]]。"}],"outgoing":["a59aab1599221f4a"]}